{"title":"ARML teams","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The following is a partial list of teams that compete at the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=American_Regions_Mathematics_League\" title=\"American Regions Mathematics League\">American Regions Mathematics League</a>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AAST_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"AAST ARML (page does not exist)\">AAST ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Alabama_ARML\" title=\"Alabama ARML\">Alabama ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Chicago_ARML\" title=\"Chicago ARML\">Chicago ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Colorado_ARML\" title=\"Colorado ARML\">Colorado ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Connecticut_ARML\" title=\"Connecticut ARML\">Connecticut ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Georgia_ARML\" title=\"Georgia ARML\">Georgia ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Florida_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Florida ARML (page does not exist)\">Florida ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Maine_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Maine ARML (page does not exist)\">Maine ARML</a></li>\n<li>Maryland - Baltimore County, Howard County, Montgomery County</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Massachusetts_ARML\" title=\"Massachusetts ARML\">Massachusetts ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Michigan_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Michigan ARML (page does not exist)\">Michigan ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Minnesota_ARML\" title=\"Minnesota ARML\">Minnesota ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Missouri_ARML\" title=\"Missouri ARML\">Missouri ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Montgomery_Blair_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Montgomery Blair ARML (page does not exist)\">Montgomery Blair ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_Jersey_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"New Jersey ARML (page does not exist)\">New Jersey ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=New_York_City_ARML\" title=\"New York City ARML\">New York City ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=North_Carolina_ARML\" title=\"North Carolina ARML\">North Carolina ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northern_California_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Northern California ARML (page does not exist)\">Northern California ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ohio_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ohio ARML (page does not exist)\">Ohio ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ontario_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Ontario ARML (page does not exist)\">Ontario ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Oregon_ARML\" title=\"Oregon ARML\">Oregon ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Peninsula_South_Bay_ARML\" title=\"Peninsula South Bay ARML\">Peninsula South Bay ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pennsylvania_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Pennsylvania ARML (page does not exist)\">Pennsylvania ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Diego_ARML\" title=\"San Diego ARML\">San Diego ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=San_Francisco_Bay_Area_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"San Francisco Bay Area ARML (page does not exist)\">San Francisco Bay Area ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=South_Carolina_ARML\" title=\"South Carolina ARML\">South Carolina ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Southern_California_ARML\" title=\"Southern California ARML\">Southern California ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Texas_ARML\" title=\"Texas ARML\">Texas ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TJHSST_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"TJHSST ARML (page does not exist)\">TJHSST ARML</a> (Thomas Jefferson High School for Science and Technology )</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//sites.google.com/upstatenymath.org/upstate-ny-math/arml-2026\">Upstate New York ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Utah_ARML\" title=\"Utah ARML\">Utah ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vermont_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Vermont ARML (page does not exist)\">Vermont ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Washington_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Washington ARML (page does not exist)\">Washington ARML</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Wisconsin_ARML&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Wisconsin ARML (page does not exist)\">Wisconsin ARML</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ARML_teams&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=ARML_historical_results\" title=\"ARML historical results\">ARML historical results</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_contest_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math contest books\">Math contest books</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018072201\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.017 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip